### 6. BGP-LS Extensions for BGP-Only Networks
* **Presenter**: Marvin d'Souza
* **Draft**: [draft-ietf-idr-bgp-ls-bgp-only-fabric](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-idr-bgp-ls-bgp-only-fabric/)
* **Technical Details**: Updates include reducing attributes to a recommended baseline, consolidating SR Policy and SRv6 sections to reference existing RFCs rather than duplicating formats, and adding TI-LFA and SRv6 deployment use cases.
* **Discussion**:
  * Marvin d'Souza shared that there is an active implementation in Sonic FRR.
  * Jeff Tantsura noted that the draft seems close to completion and suggested targeting progression by the San Francisco meeting.

